{
  "method": "Select a subset of actual app bullish labels. For each year fit regularized logistic regression on prior bullish observations whose outcomes finish before the two-year validation period. Select among fixed score quantiles on bullish validation observations with outcomes completed before test year, requiring >=30 calls, >=6 months, >=8 stocks, >=51% accuracy and >=1 percentage point over the validation bullish baseline; otherwise abstain. Features use the 90-day chart window, including fixed interactions. Test on first monthly close to first close on or after three calendar months, at most ten days late; unchanged is incorrect. Minimum 50 chart-window bars. Compare 2020-2026 eligible population and active test years; calls selected differ.",
  "limitations": [
    "The same years have been repeatedly examined and this is exploratory, not an untouched or prospective holdout. Threshold selection and feature choices introduce selection bias not covered by bootstrap intervals.",
    "Current listed stocks omit delistings, eligible samples require observable outcomes, and historical data may be revised; missing and pending outcomes are excluded.",
    "Monthly overlapping horizons and shared shocks are correlated. Prices do not represent realizable same-close entry, dividends, transaction costs, slippage or taxes. The app remains unchanged."
